      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "65a7f8d332f5163fff20ffe0",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Let's face it.  There is a real issue with children who are under the age of 13 running around as well as bad actors that have made public lobbies a sometimes uncomfortable, aggravating experience.  A lot of us use to enjoy going to public lobbies meeting new people and making new friends.  This is an experience that is few and far between these days.  With the Addition of friends plus, we have seen fewer and fewer worlds with public lobbies and many people end up floating around between the same friend groups in Friends+ instances.  \nI propose a VRC+ public instances that are only accessable to VRC+ members.   This will cut back on a lot of unwanted interactions with children and bad actors who make accounts only to crash or disrupt instances.  It may also encourage users to populate VRC+public instances over using friends plus just to avoid children and other bad actors. Especially when world hoping. \nI can't tell you how unfulfilling it is when I scroll down through the worlds that are most populated for my platform only to find all of them besides a handfull only populated by private instances.  There are probably a ton of people I will never get to meet because they hide away in Private instances.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "VRC+ Public Instances Public+",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5fb78f9f6b2eff2448a02c8a",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
    {
