      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "65a80542fff79d7b9dfc185f",
      "mergedPostDetails": "So public worlds are currently... very bad.   They are 95% visitors which are children and trolls.  Harassment is constant. Vote kicks never work.  Since the dev team doesn't want to add moderation to Public worlds, I suggest paid members can make public worlds in which only paid members can join.  This would cut down on the children and trolls significantly and let the more relaxed VRC members actually have a public experience again.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "VRC Plus Public Worlds",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5fb78f9f6b2eff2448a02c8a",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
