      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since many folks point out the issue of kids and trolls, and we now have the Age Verification feature, you might think the priority of this request has become low.\n\nHowever, this still benefits some event organizers who wish this platform would remain economically healthy and running. Although there's another way, the Creator Economy, it is not so easy (paperwork is required).\n\nCompared to that, this VRC+ limited instance idea is far easier to do.",
