      "value": "not everyone wants or can afford to buy VRC+ this basically would only serve to get vrchat more money and not fix the issue you're talking about.\n\nthe best way for you to do that is: host a group public > make it age gated > filter out people who're not being mature.\n\na VRC+ only instance does little to nothing to solve your issue its more likely that it could make that issue worse making it likely to attract worse people in general. (this practice would also serve to force players into buying VRC+ to just play vrchat instead of VRC+ being just for support of the platform and would likely lose alot of players from vrchat.)",
