      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I already despise the idea of having instances available only to select VRC+ users (those who are Age Verified). I don't think making an instance available only to VRC+ users in general is at all an inclusive idea. It may support the dev team of VRChat, but I'm definitely of age and I can't join 18+ instances without paying for a subscription beforehand. Essentially, if someone makes an 18+ instance in good faith of making sure everyone's an adult, it excludes everyone who doesn't have VRC+. It's VRChat being in and of itself a night club of sorts, being exclusive and I'm not a fan of it. They need to make age verification available to all users. If they can't afford it for everyone, at least give the option to those with known trust rank. User rank would make more sense though.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
