      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{618ece8f22b63e309408b761|full_name} VRC+ was looked down upon when I first started as being not only a waste of money, but also supporting the problem. Granted the people saying these things were using mods back then. I chose to support something I enjoyed regardless of what they were all saying, and to see this contradictory statement now, it's kind of entertaining.\n\n\"host a group public > make it age gated\"\n\nWhat is to stop someone from lying about their age? Granted I've already seen the 18+ verification defeated by submissive parents who failed at every turn with parenting. But to me this is far worse in sharing personal information than letting an AI decide whether or not my face matches an ID and is then destroyed after verifying the account.\n\nAt least I'm not catching discrimination, scrutiny, and judgement for my age when I tell the AI how old I am. I just want to enjoy my time with friends and make new ones.\n\nI had a thought to use bank checking accounts, but there's 1 bank in america that I consider the worst of them all, and it proves so with being 16 as the minimum age to open an account at that bank only.",
